  "label": "Inclusive Language",
  "description": "The phrase 'when each letter is awesome' uses inclusive language to celebrate individuality and uniqueness. In real-world contexts, inclusive language is a social and linguistic practice that aims to avoid marginalizing or excluding any group by acknowledging and valuing all identities. The meme leverages this concept to frame global diversity as inherently positive and worthy of celebration, which is a common theme in modern social movements and educational materials.",
